                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="7Recurringswap_e_31" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontFamily=Verdana;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#021640;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#CBD5E1;" parent="1" source="7Recurringswap_c_15" target="7Recurringswap_c_16" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="7Recurringswap_e_32" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontFamily=Verdana;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#021640;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#CBD5E1;" parent="1" source="7Recurringswap_c_16" target="7Recurringswap_c_17" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="7Recurringswap_e_33" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontFamily=Verdana;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#021640;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#CBD5E1;" parent="1" source="7Recurringswap_c_17" target="7Recurringswap_c_18" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="7Recurringswap_c_34" value="  (k) Key control boundary" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#F87171;dashed=1;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontColor=#FCA5A5;fontFamily=Verdana;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=2;dashPattern=8 8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="340" y="739" width="296" height="116" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="7Recurringswap_c_35" value="  ! Continuing authorisation — no per-fill signature" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#FDE047;dashed=1;strokeWidth=3;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontColor=#FEF08A;fontFamily=Verdana;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=2;dashPattern=4 4;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="960" y="1019" width="296" height="128" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="7Recurringswap_c_46" value="(i) PARTIES: user; Core Mobile app; Ava Labs backend (push notifications, price data); Markr&#39;s recurring router and its underlying DEX liquidity; the blockchain network. Same-chain only, so exactly one chain is involved.&lt;br&gt;(ii) FLOW OF FUNDS: crypto only, no fiat. Each scheduled order moves the configured amount from the user&#39;s own address through Markr&#39;s router and returns the bought asset to the same user address. Between fills the assets remain in the user&#39;s address — they are not pre-funded or escrowed with Markr. Stablecoins are a common source asset for this flow.&lt;br&gt;(iii) CUSTODY — the key point on this page. Assets are never custodied by Core or by Markr, and each fill settles back to the user&#39;s own address. BUT the first signature grants a STANDING ERC-20 ALLOWANCE to Markr&#39;s recurring router, and every subsequent order is executed by Markr against that allowance WITHOUT a contemporaneous user signature. This is a continuing authorisation rather than a per-transaction one: the user&#39;s ongoing control rests on the allowance&#39;s scope and on their ability to cancel. Selecting &quot;Unlimited&quot; orders arms the schedule indefinitely until cancelled. Pausing, resuming, and cancelling each require a fresh signature.&lt;br&gt;(iv) THIRD PARTIES: Markr operates the recurring router, holds the allowance, and decides when each order executes. It receives addresses and amounts only — no customer identity data. Eligibility rules (same-chain, native or ERC-20) are enforced by the SDK against Markr&#39;s own chain data.&lt;br&gt;(v) FEES: the same components as a single swap, incurred ONCE PER FILL — network fee, DEX liquidity-provider fee plus price impact bounded by slippage, and the aggregator fee attributed to Core via the Markr partner identifier. A schedule of N orders therefore incurs these N times. The one-off ERC-20 approve transaction carries its own network fee. As with single swaps, whether the partner identifier yields revenue for Ava Labs is not observable in the client code." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#0B2545;strokeColor=#64748B;fontColor=#E2E8F0;fontFamily=Verdana;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="1610" width="1500" height="300" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
